{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Troubles at Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Not so Funny Anymore"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Relate information about common solutions to problems in spoken and written documents."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "PlaceholderWrites effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le01ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Need</span> +Passive Infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Verb + -ing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the passive infinitive to express something that is necessary. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "It can be used in affirmative, negative and interrogative sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Need</span> plus a verb with -ing has the same meaning as a passive infinitive."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Need</span> + verb -ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Passive infinitive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The pipes need fixing.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The pipes need to be fixed.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The carpet need removing.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The carpet need to be removed.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The hardwood floors need drying.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The hardwood floors need to be dried.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "That problem needs to be solved immediately!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The walls need to be opened in the shower to work out how the water is escaping. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Causative <span class=\"italic\">Get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Have</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a causative verb when you want to talk about something that someone else did for you or for another person. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The subject caused the action to happen, but didn't do it themselves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/><span class=\"strong\">To have someone do something </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the form:<br/> subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + person + infinitive"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is an example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> I had my apprentice bring the industrial heater. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/><span class=\"strong\">To get someone to do something</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the form:<br/><span class=\"italic\">get</span> + someone + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + infinitive"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is an example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The Plumber gets his workers to complete the projects.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll also have him bring our industrial heater."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll get my apprentice to leave another job and come help."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to gush"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to flow out suddenly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Suddenly, water started gushing through the light fixture and onto the wood  and carpet. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you are talking/writing about household problems."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fixture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something attached permanently, usually to a wall. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Suddenly, water started gushing through the light fixture and onto the wood  and carpet. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deluge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a great flood of water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The deluge has stained the carpet and bowed the wood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to bow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to bend or curve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The deluge has stained the carpet and bowed the wood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a coat of plaster for finishing a ceiling or interior wall"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There may be a problem with the grout."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "industrial"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "relating to industry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll also have him bring our industrial heater."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 questions to ask them about house repairs they had done ( \u2018What have you got someone to do in your house?', who, why, etc.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Interview your friend using the questions."}, {"type": "text", "conte